  "prefLabel": "He-C 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 201.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to provide uniform practices and procedures to implement the provisions of RSA 541-A:16, I, and RSA 126-A:5, VIII concerning appeals of decisions made by the department. The provisions of these rules concerning hearings are intended to supplement the procedures established by RSA 541-A and any procedure established under any statute implemented by the department.\n\nSource. #6986, eff 4-24-99; ss by #8866-A, eff 4-13-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c200.html"
